    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given line is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and plane is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">:</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi></msqrt><mo>z</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>The angle between a line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mi>l</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and a plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><msqrt><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0328_9dbf163f237d.png\" style=\"width: 326px; height: 183px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Squaring both sides, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
